InstanceNorm1d and LayerNorm are very similar, but have some subtle differences. InstanceNorm1d is applied on each channel of channeled data like multidimensional time series, but LayerNorm is usually applied on entire sample and often in NLP tasks. Additionally, LayerNorm applies elementwise affine transform, while InstanceNorm1d usually dont apply affine transform.
